abstract: >
  A textbook covering rigorous quantitative analysis when sample sizes are
  small. Topics include study design, measurement quality, exact and
  resampling tests, nonparametric inference, penalised and Bayesian
  regression, missing data, uncertainty reporting, and five worked projects
  in R.
keywords:
  - small samples
  - quantitative methods
  - statistics
  - R
  - research methods
